# DamageSource$ Targeted (DamageDealEffect.java:135): Justice Strike's
# "target creature deals damage to itself equal to its power" is dealt by the
# target. Deadly Recluse (1/2) deals 1 damage to itself, and that damage has
# its deathtouch, so the state-based check destroys it (CR 702.2b, 704.5h).
# A spell-sourced 1 damage would have left the 2-toughness Recluse alive.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 W
queue targets 4
queue action human cast 1
passpriority
